## 2. Description of the Service

Hockey Flair Bot provides Reddit users with an interactive graphical flair selector to browse, preview, select, and clear hockey team and league user flairs on participating subreddits. Features include:
- Browsing categorized leagues, teams, and historic/alternate logo variants.
- Previewing flair representations in real time.
- Applying user flair to your account on the active subreddit.
- Optional synchronization of flairs across paired partner subreddits (e.g., `r/hockey` and `r/hockeymemes`) where enabled by community moderators.
- Optional moderator logging of flair changes via Discord webhooks.

